{"path":"about.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--accent:#6b5b95;--muted:#6c757d;--bg:#fbfbfc;--card:#fff}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;background:var(--bg);color:#222;line-height:1.4}
    header{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(107,91,149,0.12), transparent);padding:28px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}
    .nav{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .brand .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6b5b95 0%,#b8a9d6 100%);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}
    nav a{color:#333;text-decoration:none;margin:0 8px;font-weight:600}
    .nav-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .hero{max-width:1100px;margin:26px auto;padding:30px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 350px;gap:28px;align-items:start}
    .panel{background:var(--card);padding:22px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(16,24,40,0.04)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:28px;color:var(--accent)}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--muted)}
    .aside .contact{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .button{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    /* pattern background via inline svg dataURI for a bespoke motif */
    .pattern-hero{background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="400" height="120" viewBox="0 0 400 120"><defs><linearGradient id="g" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="%236b5b95" stop-opacity="0.08"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="%23b8a9d6" stop-opacity="0.04"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width="400" height="120" fill="white"/><g fill="url(%23g)"><circle cx="40" cy="40" r="14"/><circle cx="120" cy="20" r="10"/><circle cx="220" cy="60" r="20"/><rect x="300" y="10" width="40" height="40" rx="8"/></g></svg>');background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:right top;padding-right:40px}

    /* Proof gallery */
    .proof{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .testimony{min-height:86px;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(107,91,149,0.04),transparent);font-style:italic;color:#2b2b2b}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
    .badge{display:inline-flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);cursor:default;position:relative}
    .badge svg{width:18px;height:18px}
    .tooltip{position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);bottom:calc(100% + 8px);background:#222;color:#fff;padding:6px 8px;font-size:13px;border-radius:6px;white-space:nowrap;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity 120ms ease}
    .badge:focus .tooltip,.badge:hover .tooltip{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}

    /* Accordion */
    .accordion{margin-top:18px}
    .acc-item{border-top:1px dashed rgba(0,0,0,0.06)}
    .acc-toggle{width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:14px;border:none;background:none;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .acc-content{padding:0 14px 18px 14px;color:var(--muted);display:none}
    .acc-toggle[aria-expanded="true"] + .acc-content{display:block}

    footer{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    .crisis{margin-top:10px;border-left:4px solid #ffb4b4;background:#fff7f7;padding:12px;border-radius:8px}
    @media (max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.aside{order:2}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="nav">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">CT</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="primary navigation">
      <a href="index.html">Start</a>
      <a href="about.html">Practice</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Fees</a>
      <a href="faq.html">Questions</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Reach</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="nav-right">
      <a class="button" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero pattern-hero">
    <div class="panel">
      <h1>Care that helps you find steadiness in small, clear steps</h1>
      <p class="lead">I offer focused, private clinical work for adults navigating transition, uncertainty, or decision points. Sessions hold attention to what matters now and create practical, real-world shifts.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px">
        <a class="button" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">Begin a conversation</a>
        <a href="contact.html" style="color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none">Ask a question</a>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:18px" class="panel">
        <strong>What I bring</strong>
        <ul style="margin:8px 0 0 18px;color:var(--muted)">
          <li>Evidence-informed approaches blended with practical planning</li>
          <li>Confidential, session-based focus to suit your pace</li>
          <li>Clear boundaries about scope, assessment, and referrals</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="aside">
      <div class="panel">
        <div style="font-weight:700">Contact</div>
        <div class="contact">
          <div style="color:var(--muted)">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
          <div style="color:var(--muted)">Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          <div style="color:var(--muted)">Location: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <a class="button" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">Schedule intake</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel" style="margin-top:16px">
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px">Proof & credibility</div>
        <div class="proof" id="proof-compact">
          <div class="testimony" id="compact-text">"Thoughtful sessions that helped me notice what matters most in my week." — J.</div>
          <div class="badges" id="badges-compact">
            <div tabindex="0" class="badge" aria-describedby="b1-desc">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="#6b5b95" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M8 12.2l2.2 2.2L16 9" stroke="#6b5b95" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              <div style="font-size:13px">Clinical license</div>
              <div class="tooltip" role="tooltip" id="b1-desc">Licensed clinician, state board credentialed</div>
            </div>
            <div tabindex="0" class="badge">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="4" stroke="#6b5b95" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M7 12h10" stroke="#6b5b95" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
              <div style="font-size:13px">Training</div>
              <div class="tooltip">Advanced training in relational and cognitive approaches</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section style="max-width:1100px;margin:20px auto;padding:0 20px">
    <div class="panel">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">Session boundaries & confidentiality</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--muted)">Below are practical details about how sessions and communication are handled. If something here feels unclear, we can review it in your intake.</p>

      <div class="accordion" id="accordion">
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="acc-1" id="acc-btn-1">How long are sessions?<span aria-hidden="true">▸</span></button>
          <div class="acc-content" id="acc-1">Standard sessions are 50 minutes. Occasionally, different lengths are offered for focused work; these will be described in the program details and during intake. Scheduling and cancellations are discussed at first contact.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="acc-2" id="acc-btn-2">Confidentiality & limits</button>
          <div class="acc-content" id="acc-2">Conversations are confidential within the limits of law: duty to protect from imminent harm, suspected abuse of a vulnerable person, or court-ordered disclosures. Administrative communication (scheduling, billing) is minimal and handled with care. If coordination with other providers is helpful, it will only occur with your informed consent.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="acc-3" id="acc-btn-3">Records & notes</button>
          <div class="acc-content" id="acc-3">Clinical notes summarize topics, agreed plans, and clinical impressions; they are retained in secure records. You may request a conversation about your records; legal exceptions may apply.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:16px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
        <a class="button" href="book.html">Request an intake</a>
        <a href="contact.html" style="color:var(--muted)">Contact for questions</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <div>Scope & crisis note: Therapy focuses on emotional, relational, and behavioral concerns. This service is not an emergency resource. If you are in immediate danger or require urgent medical help, call local emergency services or the national crisis line (for example, 988 in the U.S.). If you feel unsafe between sessions, use your local emergency resources.</div>
    </footer>
  </section>
</main>

<script>
// Accordion behavior
document.querySelectorAll('.acc-toggle').forEach(btn=>{
  btn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
    const expanded = btn.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';
    btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!expanded));
  });
});

// Compact proof rotation (used in aside)
(function(){
  const texts = [
    '"I left sessions with clearer priorities and less noise in my head." — M.',
    '"Kind, direct conversations that helped me take one useful step at a time." — S.',
    '"Professional, steady support when important choices came up." — R.'
  ];
  let i = 0; const el = document.getElementById('compact-text');
  setInterval(()=>{
    i = (i+1) % texts.length; el.textContent = texts[i];
  },6000);
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"specialties.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Focus Areas — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--accent:#2a9d8f;--muted:#53626b;--bg:#f7faf9}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial;background:var(--bg);color:#123}
    header{background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04);padding:14px}
    .nav{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .nav a{margin:0 8px;color:#123;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    main{max-width:1100px;margin:22px auto;padding:0 20px}
    .hero{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}
    .hero .title{font-size:22px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:18px}
    .card{background:#fff;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(16,24,40,0.03)}
    h3{margin:0 0 8px}
    p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:14px}
    .outline{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);background:transparent}
    /* responsive */
    @media (max-width:980px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
    @media (max-width:640px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

    /* Proof gallery full width */
    .proof-full{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:18px;gap:12px}
    .testimonial-large{flex:1;padding:18px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(42,157,143,0.06),transparent);font-style:italic}
    .cred-list{display:flex;gap:12px}
    .cred{background:#fff;padding:8px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
    .cred .tip{position:relative}
    .cred .tip .hint{position:absolute;top:-34px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#222;color:#fff;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;opacity:0;transition:opacity 140ms;pointer-events:none}
    .cred .tip:hover .hint{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}

  </style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="nav">
    <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Start</a>
      <a href="about.html">Practice</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <div>
      <div class="title">Clinical focus areas</div>
      <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">Common reasons people seek short-term, concentrated work or ongoing therapy.</div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-left:auto">
      <a class="outline" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid">
    <article class="card">
      <h3>Transitions & decisions</h3>
      <p>Life changes can feel disorienting. I support decision-making by clarifying values, evaluating options, and practicing steps toward a chosen direction.</p>
      <div class="cta-row"><a class="outline" href="contact.html">Ask about an intensive</a></div>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h3>Work-related stress & identity</h3>
      <p>Boundaries, burnout, and professional transitions are addressed with tools for planning, communication rehearsal, and pacing.</p>
      <div class="cta-row"><a class="outline" href="contact.html">Explore availability</a></div>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h3>Relationships & communication</h3>
      <p>Focus on clearer conversations, repair strategies, and managing emotional reactivity in everyday interactions.</p>
      <div class="cta-row"><a class="outline" href="contact.html">Discuss fit</a></div>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h3>Anxiety & recurring rumination</h3>
      <p>Short blocks of work can create practical routines for attention, worry-management, and preventing spirals that interfere with daily functioning.</p>
      <div class="cta-row"><a class="outline" href="contact.html">See programs</a></div>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h3>Life-care planning & practical goals</h3>
      <p>Concrete planning—step-by-step exploration of finances, housing, caregiving, or career moves—integrated with emotional support.</p>
      <div class="cta-row"><a class="outline" href="contact.html">Inquire</a></div>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h3>Grief & change</h3>
      <p>Grief can look different for everyone. Sessions focus on containing emotional intensity, honoring losses, and finding manageable next steps.</p>
      <div class="cta-row"><a class="outline" href="contact.html">Reach out</a></div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="proof-full">
    <div class="testimonial-large" id="testimonial-large">"The short package helped me move through one big decision without getting overwhelmed." — K.</div>
    <div style="width:220px">
      <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px">Credentials</div>
      <div class="cred-list">
        <div class="cred tip" tabindex="0">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="#2a9d8f" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>
          <div style="font-size:13px">Licensed</div>
          <div class="hint">State-licensed clinician with formal training</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cred tip" tabindex="0">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="4" stroke="#2a9d8f" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>
          <div style="font-size:13px">Supervision</div>
          <div class="hint">Regular professional consultation and peer review</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="margin-top:18px">
    <div style="background:#fff;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(16,24,40,0.03)">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0">Program frames & investments</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--muted)">Work is offered in two common frames. Rather than guaranteeing outcomes, these are options for structuring time and focus.</p>
      <ul style="color:var(--muted)">
        <li><strong>Focused Block</strong> — 3 to 6 sessions with explicit goals and a simple plan for practice between meetings. Good for a clear decision or an immediate problem.</li>
        <li><strong>Foundational Series</strong> — 6 to 12 sessions for deeper pattern work and skill-building over time. Useful when changes require habit and support.</li>
      </ul>
      <div style="margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)">Fee details are discussed during contact; sliding-scale options may be available based on currently offered openings.</div>
      <div style="margin-top:12px"><a class="outline" href="fees.html">Learn about fees</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer style="margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">
    <div>Confidentiality reminder: Written and electronic records are kept securely. Limits to confidentiality include imminent harm, abuse, or legal orders. If you need immediate help, contact local emergency services or a crisis line such as 988 (U.S.).</div>
  </footer>
</main>

<script>
// Larger testimonial rotation and small interactions
(function(){
  const msgs = [
    '"Practical, steady support during a chaotic few months." — A.',
    '"Helped me plan and practice; small steps led to real change." — L.',
    '"A calm, experienced clinician who helped me map choices." — T.'
  ];
  let idx = 0; const el = document.getElementById('testimonial-large');
  setInterval(()=>{ idx = (idx+1) % msgs.length; el.textContent = msgs[idx]; },7000);
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"approach.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Method & Process — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--accent:#d9554b;--muted:#5b6770;--bg:#fff}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial;background:var(--bg);color:#112}
    header{padding:14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}
    .nav{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .nav a{margin:0 6px;color:#112;text-decoration:none}

    main{max-width:1100px;margin:20px auto;padding:0 20px}
    .lead{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(217,85,75,0.06),transparent);padding:18px;border-radius:12px}
    .pillars{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}
    .pillar{flex:1;background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(16,24,40,0.04)}
    .steps{margin-top:18px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}
    .step{background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px}
    .case{margin-top:18px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(217,85,75,0.04),transparent);padding:14px;border-radius:10px}
    .session-boundaries{margin-top:18px;background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px}

    @media (max-width:880px){.pillars{flex-direction:column}.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="nav">
    <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Start</a>
      <a href="about.html">Practice</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Reach</a>
    </nav>
    <div><a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" style="background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="lead">
    <h1 style="margin:0;color:var(--accent)">How I work</h1>
    <p style="margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted)">My work blends practical planning with clinically informed approaches — oriented to the question at hand, and to the rhythms of daily life.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="pillars">
    <div class="pillar">
      <strong>Attentive assessment</strong>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">An initial intake clarifies immediate concerns, context, supports, and safety. This shapes whether a short block or a longer plan fits best.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar">
      <strong>Practical tools</strong>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">We identify a small set of practices (experiments, scheduling shifts, communication rehearsals) that are feasible between sessions.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar">
      <strong>Relational focus</strong>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Change happens in relationships and routines; sessions pay attention to how moves will land in your real life.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="steps" aria-label="Typical flow">
    <div class="step">
      <strong>1. Brief intake</strong>
      <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">20–35 minute conversation to clarify needs, logistics, and immediate priorities.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <strong>2. Choose a frame</strong>
      <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">A focused block or a series — we decide together what's reasonable and useful.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <strong>3. Practical sessions</strong>
      <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">Sessions include reflection, strategy, and at least one concrete next action to try between meetings.</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="case">
    <strong>Case note — example</strong>
    <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Client presented with persistent indecision about a career shift. Intake focused on values, constraints, and a 3-session plan. Over three sessions we clarified priorities, practiced communication scripts, and created a timeline for a trial project. This framed decision-making with less overwhelm.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="session-boundaries">
    <h3 style="margin-top:0">Session and communication boundaries</h3>
    <p style="color:var(--muted)">Sessions are 50 minutes unless another length is agreed. Email and messaging are used for scheduling and brief coordination only. Clinical contact for urgent matters should be handled by local emergency services or crisis resources.</p>

    <details>
      <summary style="font-weight:700;cursor:pointer">Confidentiality details</summary>
      <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Information is confidential except for legal limits (risk of harm, abuse, or court orders). Releases for information exchange are written and time-limited.</div>
    </details>

